msgctxt "Duo|GitLab Duo reads exclusion rules and custom instructions from the source project and applies them to code reviews across the group. For more information, see %{linkStart}custom review instructions%{linkEnd}."
msgid "Duo|GitLab Duo reads exclusion rules and custom instructions from the source project and applies them to code reviews across the group. For more information, see %{linkStart}custom review instructions%{linkEnd}."
msgstr "GitLab Duo läser undantagsregler och anpassade instruktioner från källprojektet och tillämpar dem på kodgranskningar i hela gruppen. Mer information finns i %{linkStart}anpassade granskningsinstruktioner%{linkEnd}."

