msgctxt "EmailOTP|On %{date}, GitLab will begin requiring email one-time passcodes for your account. To avoid being locked out, make sure you can access your primary email address (%{strong_open}%{email}%{strong_close}) and have verified any secondary email addresses before this date."
msgid "EmailOTP|On %{date}, GitLab will begin requiring email one-time passcodes for your account. To avoid being locked out, make sure you can access your primary email address (%{strong_open}%{email}%{strong_close}) and have verified any secondary email addresses before this date."
msgstr "Den %{date} börjar GitLab kräva engångskoder via e-post för ditt konto. För att undvika att bli utelåst måste du säkerställa att du kan komma åt din primära e-postadress (%{strong_open}%{email}%{strong_close}) och har verifierat eventuella sekundära e-postadresser före detta datum."

